  "description": {
    "raw": "The targets of this spell become angrier as they fight, the pain of their wounds fueling their strength. An affected creature gains a cumulative +2 morale bonus to Strength and a cumulative –1 penalty to AC for every 5 points of damage it takes (maximum +10 Strength, –5 AC) for the duration of the spell. These bonuses last until the spell expires or the target falls unconscious.",
    "search_text": "\"the targets of this spell become angrier as they fight, the pain of their wounds fueling their strength. an affected creature gains a cumulative +2 morale bonus to strength and a cumulative –1 penalty to ac for every 5 points of damage it takes (maximum +10 strength, –5 ac) for the duration of the spell. these bonuses last until the spell expires or the target falls unconscious.\"",
